[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0010","text":"哇……！\n你们看，凛世小姐，小梢前辈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0020","text":"梅花……！\n已经开了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0030","text":"有盛开的……\n也有……刚刚绽放的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0040","text":"春天的……到访……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0050","text":"——春天的到访，那边也开了好多！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0060","text":"好厉害——！\n看到的全都是春天的到访呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0070","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0080","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0090","text":"黄莺也……像是来……\n报春的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200200_04_0100","text":"嚯——\n嚯凯啾……"}]
